      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 5.59,
          "en": "So what would be a good next step?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.59,
          "end": 8.17,
          "en": "Well, I would say a good next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.17,
          "end": 11.39,
          "en": "would be to ensure that the buttons here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.39,
          "end": 14.48,
          "en": "and the text input, which we can't really see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.48,
          "end": 15.505,
          "en": "but which is there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.505,
          "end": 19.24,
          "en": "that these elements are a bit more centered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.24,
          "end": 21.692,
          "en": "and not sitting directly on those edges",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.692,
          "end": 23.97,
          "en": "where we can't really use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.97,
          "end": 25.91,
          "en": "That would be very useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.91,
          "end": 26.81,
          "en": "And to achieve this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.81,
          "end": 29.3,
          "en": "we can go back to the StartGameScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.3,
          "end": 32.96,
          "en": "because that is where we have this View",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.96,
          "end": 36.07,
          "en": "with the input element and the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.07,
          "end": 38.7,
          "en": "And of course, we can now position this View",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.7,
          "end": 42.27,
          "en": "and we can change how it's positioned and laid out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.27,
          "end": 44.36,
          "en": "And for this, you learnt that we do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.36,
          "end": 47.47,
          "en": "with help of the StyleSheet object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.47,
          "end": 49.69,
          "en": "that is exposed by React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.69,
          "end": 53.47,
          "en": "because this allows us to create a style sheet object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.47,
          "end": 55.62,
          "en": "which allows us to set up styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.62,
          "end": 57.15,
          "en": "that can then be attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.15,
          "end": 59.603,
          "en": "to our different Components and elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.46,
          "end": 65.4,
          "en": "So here, I'll add a styles constant with StyleSheet.create,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 67.06,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.06,
          "end": 68.77,
          "en": "Now, in here, the question is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.77,
          "end": 71.05,
          "en": "which kind of styles do we want?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.05,
          "end": 73.99,
          "en": "And I wanna start with a basic style for the main View",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.99,
          "end": 75.274,
          "en": "that wraps these elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.274,
          "end": 78.68,
          "en": "which ensures that this View is a bit more away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.68,
          "end": 81.26,
          "en": "from the edges of the device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.26,
          "end": 85.16,
          "en": "So we'll name this style object inputContainer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.16,
          "end": 87.43,
          "en": "The name is up to you though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.43,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "and it will add flex one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 91.27,
          "en": "Flex one, as you learnt before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.27,
          "end": 95.738,
          "en": "ensures that the element on which we add this styling object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.738,
          "end": 99.12,
          "en": "takes up as much space as it can.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.12,
          "end": 101.99000000000001,
          "en": "So that could be the entire space on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.99000000000001,
          "end": 105.63,
          "en": "or if there is another sibling element somewhere,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.63,
          "end": 108.22,
          "en": "they would split the available space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.22,
          "end": 112.84,
          "en": "depending on the flex options set on that sibling container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.84,
          "end": 114.39,
          "en": "Here, it will be the only container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.39,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "and therefore it should take up the entire available space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 121.7,
          "en": "Now, in addition, I will also add some padding here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.7,
          "end": 125.11,
          "en": "so that we have some distance to the edges.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.11,
          "end": 128.52,
          "en": "And I will add 16 pixels of padding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.52,
          "end": 130.52,
          "en": "though you can, of course, play around with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.52,
          "end": 133.303,
          "en": "to find the right amount for your requirements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.16,
          "end": 137.07,
          "en": "I will also add some extra margin to the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.07,
          "end": 141.32,
          "en": "so some extra distance to the top, outside of the box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.32,
          "end": 143.05,
          "en": "Though it won't matter too much right now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.05,
          "end": 146.1,
          "en": "because we have no background or border anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.1,
          "end": 150.02,
          "en": "So we don't really see where the View box ends and starts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.02,
          "end": 152.68,
          "en": "But still, I'll use marginTop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.68,
          "end": 155.11,
          "en": "Instead of marginTop of 100 pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.11,
          "end": 158.72,
          "en": "to push this View to which I'll add my styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.72,
          "end": 161.583,
          "en": "away from the top edge of the device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.76,
          "end": 163.96,
          "en": "And speaking of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.96,
          "end": 166.082,
          "en": "we can now add the style prop to this View",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.082,
          "end": 167.82,
          "en": "that holds the text input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 170.93,
          "en": "and add styles.inputContainer to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.93,
          "end": 174.823,
          "en": "so that these styles are applied to this View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.67000000000002,
          "end": 177.61,
          "en": "And if you do that and save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.61,
          "end": 181.43,
          "en": "it should automatically refresh your applications here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.43,
          "end": 182.91,
          "en": "on your devices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 182.91,
          "end": 184.771,
          "en": "And now the content is a bit further away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.771,
          "end": 186.69,
          "en": "from the device edges,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 186.69,
          "end": 188.49,
          "en": "which is nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.49,
          "end": 190.55,
          "en": "Of course, that's not all we wanna do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 190.55,
          "end": 192.03,
          "en": "when it comes to layouting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 192.03,
          "end": 194.09,
          "en": "It's just a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.09,
          "end": 197.373,
          "en": "As a next step, it would be nice to have some background",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 197.373,
          "end": 200.19,
          "en": "behind this entire input area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.19,
          "end": 202.686,
          "en": "So behind the input element and the buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.686,
          "end": 207.06,
          "en": "which separates the input area from the rest of the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 207.06,
          "end": 209.21,
          "en": "At the moment, everything is white here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 209.21,
          "end": 211.56,
          "en": "Later, we will add a background image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 211.56,
          "end": 215.51,
          "en": "But either way, I wanna visually separate the input area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 215.51,
          "end": 218.77,
          "en": "from the background of this screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 218.77,
          "end": 220.822,
          "en": "And therefore, what I'll do as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 220.822,
          "end": 223.69299999999998,
          "en": "is I'll add a backgroundColor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 225.22,
          "end": 227.53,
          "en": "to this inputContainer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 227.53,
          "end": 231.24,
          "en": "which is the element that holds my input element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 231.24,
          "end": 232.653,
          "en": "and the primary button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 234.4,
          "end": 237.01,
          "en": "And I'll add a background color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 237.01,
          "end": 239.29,
          "en": "which I prepared in advance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 239.29,
          "end": 242.013,
          "en": "which has a hex code of 27063c,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 245.58,
          "end": 248.103,
          "en": "which is this plum color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.07,
          "end": 252.08,
          "en": "If I save this, we got this background color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 252.08,
          "end": 253.94,
          "en": "And because of flex one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 253.94,
          "end": 256.76,
          "en": "it's basically taking up the entire screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.76,
          "end": 259.34,
          "en": "We just have some white space up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 259.34,
          "end": 261.71,
          "en": "because we have marginTop 100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 261.71,
          "end": 265.697,
          "en": "So the entire container does take up all the space it can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 265.697,
          "end": 269.5,
          "en": "but it is pushed away from the top by 100 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 269.5,
          "end": 271.61,
          "en": "And that's this white area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 271.61,
          "end": 273.92,
          "en": "But the rest now has this color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 273.92,
          "end": 277,
          "en": "Now, this is actually not the look I want though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 277,
          "end": 278.996,
          "en": "Instead I just want to have a tiny box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 278.996,
          "end": 281,
          "en": "around the input and the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 281,
          "end": 283.953,
          "en": "I don't wanna add a background to the entire screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 284.86,
          "end": 288.504,
          "en": "Now this could be achieved by actually removing flex one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 288.504,
          "end": 292.24,
          "en": "If we do that, it only takes up the space it needs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 292.24,
          "end": 294.43,
          "en": "to squeeze the elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 294.43,
          "end": 297.82,
          "en": "the content off this box into itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 297.82,
          "end": 300.229,
          "en": "So now it only takes up as much space as needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 300.229,
          "end": 302.387,
          "en": "by the text input and the buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 302.387,
          "end": 305,
          "en": "and the padding added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 305,
          "end": 307.209,
          "en": "And for the moment, that's closer to what I want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 307.209,
          "end": 310.28,
          "en": "even though we will fine tune this again later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 310.28,
          "end": 312.863,
          "en": "But for the moment, we have this input area here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 313.72,
          "end": 316.993,
          "en": "As a second step, I will now also add a marginHorizontal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 318.47,
          "end": 323,
          "en": "so left and right of 24 pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 323,
          "end": 326.17,
          "en": "so that we also have some space into the left and right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 326.17,
          "end": 329.8,
          "en": "And I wanna add rounded corners to this input area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 329.8,
          "end": 332.397,
          "en": "So therefore, I'll also add borderRadius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 332.397,
          "end": 337.397,
          "en": "and give this a border radius of let's say, eight pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 339.31,
          "end": 342.973,
          "en": "So if we save this, we now have these nice rounded corners.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 343.99,
          "end": 345.88,
          "en": "In addition, I think it would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 345.88,
          "end": 348.98,
          "en": "to have a little bit of a shadow behind this box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 348.98,
          "end": 352.09000000000003,
          "en": "And that's also something we haven't done before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 352.09000000000003,
          "end": 354.38,
          "en": "And adding shadows is different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 354.38,
          "end": 357.6,
          "en": "from what you know from web development.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 357.6,
          "end": 360.47,
          "en": "Because in web development, if you would add a shadow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 360.47,
          "end": 364.53,
          "en": "you could do this by adding the boxShadow CSS property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 364.53,
          "end": 367.75,
          "en": "But this does not exist in React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 367.75,
          "end": 369.75,
          "en": "Instead, if you wanna add a shadow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 369.75,
          "end": 371.14,
          "en": "there are two main ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 371.14,
          "end": 373.283,
          "en": "which differ between Android and iOS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 374.39,
          "end": 377.87,
          "en": "On Android, you can add a elevation property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 377.87,
          "end": 381.327,
          "en": "here to your styling, which does not exist in CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 381.327,
          "end": 384.49,
          "en": "but which instead is React Native specific.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 384.49,
          "end": 388.46,
          "en": "And elevation takes a value like zero, one, two, three",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 388.46,
          "end": 389.42,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 389.42,
          "end": 392.45,
          "en": "So we have different levels of elevation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 392.45,
          "end": 396.28,
          "en": "And the higher the level, the more shadow will be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 396.28,
          "end": 399.34000000000003,
          "en": "If I add four, for example, what you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 400.2,
          "end": 402.21,
          "en": "is that on the Android device,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 402.21,
          "end": 406.33,
          "en": "we now have a tiny shadow behind this box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 406.33,
          "end": 410.5,
          "en": "It might be clearer if you pick a higher number like eight.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 410.5,
          "end": 413.45,
          "en": "If you set eight, now we can see it a bit more clearly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 413.45,
          "end": 414.613,
          "en": "that there is a shadow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 416.18,
          "end": 418.86,
          "en": "Now I will go back to four, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 418.86,
          "end": 421.27,
          "en": "So we have a little bit of a background shadow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 421.27,
          "end": 422.63,
          "en": "on Android now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 422.63,
          "end": 426.3,
          "en": "but we have absolutely no shadow on iOS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 426.3,
          "end": 427.25,
          "en": "And the reason for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 427.25,
          "end": 431.56,
          "en": "is that elevation indeed is a Android-only property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 431.56,
          "end": 433.3,
          "en": "It has no effect on iOS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 433.3,
          "end": 436,
          "en": "because you can't add shadows with elevation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 436,
          "end": 438.4,
          "en": "It's a Android-specific concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 438.4,
          "end": 439.88,
          "en": "And here, it's really important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 439.88,
          "end": 442.93,
          "en": "to keep in mind that all these Views,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 442.93,
          "end": 445.14300000000003,
          "en": "all these core Components which we're using,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 445.14300000000003,
          "end": 448.02,
          "en": "are compiled to native Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 448.02,
          "end": 449.83,
          "en": "for the different platforms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 449.83,
          "end": 454.28,
          "en": "And we have different native Components for Android and iOS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 454.28,
          "end": 455.94,
          "en": "And these native Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 455.94,
          "end": 458.52,
          "en": "support different style properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 458.52,
          "end": 460.85,
          "en": "in their native languages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 460.85,
          "end": 463.34000000000003,
          "en": "And the style properties we said here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 463.34000000000003,
          "end": 465.24,
          "en": "are in the end also translated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 465.24,
          "end": 469.03,
          "en": "to native style instructions by a React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 469.03,
          "end": 472.29,
          "en": "and many style properties can be translated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 472.29,
          "end": 475.82,
          "en": "into fitting instructions for both operating systems,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 475.82,
          "end": 477.374,
          "en": "iOS and Android.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 477.374,
          "end": 481.31,
          "en": "But the elevation property is an exception.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 481.31,
          "end": 484.58,
          "en": "It can be translated into an appropriate instruction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 484.58,
          "end": 487.37,
          "en": "on Android, but there is no equivalent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 487.37,
          "end": 490.46,
          "en": "to this elevation concept in iOS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 490.46,
          "end": 493.33,
          "en": "And that's why we have no shadow there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 493.33,
          "end": 496.307,
          "en": "If we wanna add a shadow for iOS, we can do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 496.307,
          "end": 499.65,
          "en": "But we do it with a different set of properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 499.65,
          "end": 503.675,
          "en": "with the shadow properties, shadowColour, shadowOffset,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 503.675,
          "end": 507.13,
          "en": "shadowOpacity and shadowRadius.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 507.13,
          "end": 509.1,
          "en": "These four properties together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 509.1,
          "end": 511.4,
          "en": "allow us to add a shadow on iOS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 511.4,
          "end": 514.853,
          "en": "in addition to adding a shadow on Android with elevation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 515.83,
          "end": 519.53,
          "en": "Now, shadowColor allows you to pick the color of the shadow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 519.53,
          "end": 522,
          "en": "You could create a reddish shadow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 522,
          "end": 524.698,
          "en": "but here I'll use black as a shadowColor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 524.698,
          "end": 527.048,
          "en": "But of course, you can pick any color you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 528.13,
          "end": 531.53,
          "en": "ShadowOffset then wants an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 531.53,
          "end": 535.51,
          "en": "where you control how much the shadow should be offset",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 535.51,
          "end": 538.155,
          "en": "from the original object to which it belongs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 538.155,
          "end": 540.351,
          "en": "to the left and to the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 540.351,
          "end": 544.68,
          "en": "Therefore, you have a width and a height property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 544.68,
          "end": 547.85,
          "en": "which you can set and you set a number here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 547.85,
          "end": 550.13,
          "en": "which will be treated as pixels",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 550.13,
          "end": 553.42,
          "en": "by which the shadow will be offset.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 553.42,
          "end": 556.005,
          "en": "For example, if I choose zero for the width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 556.005,
          "end": 557.967,
          "en": "and two for the height,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 557.967,
          "end": 562.12,
          "en": "the shadow will not be offset to the left or right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 562.12,
          "end": 566.01,
          "en": "but it will be pushed down a little bit by two pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 566.01,
          "end": 568.002,
          "en": "And you can play around with these values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 568.002,
          "end": 571.52,
          "en": "to find the shadow positioning you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 571.52,
          "end": 574.78,
          "en": "Now, what you also need to set is the shadowRadius.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 574.78,
          "end": 579.05,
          "en": "This basically controls how much the shadow expands,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 579.05,
          "end": 580.49,
          "en": "so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 580.49,
          "end": 583.28,
          "en": "And here I'll choose six because again here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 583.28,
          "end": 586.11,
          "en": "you provide a value which is a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 586.11,
          "end": 588.09,
          "en": "and you can play around with that value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 588.09,
          "end": 591.41,
          "en": "to see the impact of different numbers on the shadow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 591.41,
          "end": 592.593,
          "en": "that is created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 593.9,
          "end": 596.54,
          "en": "Last but not least, you can add a shadowOpacity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 596.54,
          "end": 600.2,
          "en": "to control how transparent a shadow is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 600.2,
          "end": 604.32,
          "en": "For example, here, I'll set this to 0.25.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 604.32,
          "end": 606.7,
          "en": "But you can play around with this value as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 606.7,
          "end": 610.46,
          "en": "to see how that influences the effect of a shadow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 610.46,
          "end": 612.213,
          "en": "and how strong a shadow is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 613.61,
          "end": 616.52,
          "en": "Now, with those settings here, if we save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 211,
          "start": 616.52,
          "end": 618.41,
          "en": "we now have a nice little shadow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 212,
          "start": 618.41,
          "end": 621.32,
          "en": "behind the box on iOS as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 213,
          "start": 621.32,
          "end": 625.48,
          "en": "And we have the elevation-related shadow on Android.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 214,
          "start": 625.48,
          "end": 626.71,
          "en": "Now, if I would, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 215,
          "start": 626.71,
          "end": 628.952,
          "en": "crank up the shadowOpacity to one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 216,
          "start": 628.952,
          "end": 633.15,
          "en": "you would see that the shadow is much stronger on iOS now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 217,
          "start": 633.15,
          "end": 633.983,
          "en": "So that's what I meant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 218,
          "start": 633.983,
          "end": 635.181,
          "en": "You can play around with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 219,
          "start": 635.181,
          "end": 638.55,
          "en": "to get a feeling for how this shadow works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 220,
          "start": 638.55,
          "end": 640.89,
          "en": "Here, I just wanna have a little bit of a shadow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 221,
          "start": 640.89,
          "end": 643.85,
          "en": "and therefore, I'll set it up like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 222,
          "start": 643.85,
          "end": 646.31,
          "en": "And that's another major step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 223,
